- stylized_2d: lock the named 2D medium for every frame (ukiyo-e, cel, watercolor, pixel art, graphic novel); prefer cfg_scale 6.0-7.5; denoise 0.85-1.00; step_count 20-30.
- backrooms: first-person analog camcorder unless the intent locks the camera; prefer cfg_scale 5.0-6.5; denoise 0.80-1.00; step_count 24-32. When the camera is unlocked, copy these exact tokens: first-person camcorder tracking, heavy VHS artifacting, handheld walking momentum, continuous unbroken shot, realistic camera shake, 1990s home video aesthetic.
